status\\n- ❌ Not authenticated: \\\"Not logged into any site\\\" or authentication error\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_051\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":54,\"end_line\":56,\"quote\":\"```bash\\nnpx netlify login\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_052\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":58,\"end_line\":58,\"quote\":\"This opens a browser window for OAuth authentication. Wait for user to complete login, then verify with `netlify status` again.\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_088\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":196,\"end_line\":197,\"quote\":\"**\\\"Not logged in\\\"**\\n→ Run `npx netlify login`\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/1/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/1/instructions/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/2/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/2/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/4\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/5\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\",\"embedded_content\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_4\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"浏览器认证不可用时，可设置 NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN 环境变量；token 可在指定 Netlify URL 生成。\",\"actual_representation\":\"记录为 graph-level constraints 8/9；没有环境变量设置操作或替代认证分支。\",\"reason\":\"源文以许可/替代方式表述，受控回述以声明约束保留；未把许可改写成强制动作。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_054\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":62,\"end_line\":62,\"quote\":\"If browser authentication isn't available, users can set:\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_055\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":64,\"end_line\":66,\"quote\":\"```bash\\nexport NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN=your_token_here\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_056\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":68,\"end_line\":68,\"quote\":\"Tokens can be generated at: https://app.netlify.com/user/applications#personal-access-tokens\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/8\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/9\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"declared_constraint\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_5\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"从 netlify status 输出判断站点链接状态：已链接则跳过链接创建步骤；未链接则进入 Git remote 链接或创建流程。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_002 输出 site_link_status；边将 authenticated and site linked 送到安装依赖块，将 authenticated and site not linked 送到 Git remote 检查块；登录后 block_004 同样分流。\",\"reason\":\"链接状态检测和两个主要分流均被记录，已链接路径确实跳过链接创建块。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_057\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":70,\"end_line\":74,\"quote\":\"### 2. Detect Site Link Status\\n\\nFrom `netlify status` output, determine:\\n- **Linked**: Site already connected to Netlify (shows site name/URL)\\n- **Not linked**: Need to link or create site\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_060\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":78,\"end_line\":78,\"quote\":\"**If already linked** → Skip to step 4\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_061\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":80,\"end_line\":80,\"quote\":\"**If not linked**, attempt to link by Git remote:\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/1/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/3\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/6\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/7\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_6\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"未链接时：用 git remote show origin 检查 Git-based；若存在则提取 remote URL；尝试 npx netlify link --git-remote-url <REMOTE_URL>；链接失败则 npx netlify init。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_006 读取 git remote origin，输出 git_remote_url 和 git_remote_exists，条件边到 block_007 或 block_008；block_007 使用 result_006 链接，失败边到 block_008。\",\"reason\":\"Git 检查、URL 输入、链接操作及失败回退到 init 均有对应块、输入和边。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_062\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":82,\"end_line\":91,\"quote\":\"```bash\\n# Check if project is Git-based\\ngit remote show origin\\n\\n# If Git-based, extract remote URL\\n# Format: https://github.com/username/repo or git@github.com:username/repo.git\\n\\n# Try to link by Git remote\\nnpx netlify link --git-remote-url <REMOTE_URL>\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_063\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":93,\"end_line\":98,\"quote\":\"**If link fails** (site doesn't exist on Netlify):\\n\\n```bash\\n# Create new site interactively\\nnpx netlify init\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_089\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":199,\"end_line\":200,\"quote\":\"**\\\"No site linked\\\"**\\n→ Run `npx netlify link` or `npx netlify init`\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/5/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/6/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/8\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/9\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/10\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/11\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"embedded_content\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_7\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"omitted\",\"source_requirement\":\"npx netlify init 引导用户选择 team/account、设置 site name、配置 build settings、需要时创建 netlify.toml。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_008 只有 netlify_init 输入 netlify-cli 并输出 site_is_new；没有记录这些交互子步骤或 netlify.toml 创建条件。\",\"reason\":\"源文明示 init 的引导内容；受控回述用开放 opcode 和名称代替，不能据此推断内部步骤。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_064\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":95,\"end_line\":98,\"quote\":\"```bash\\n# Create new site interactively\\nnpx netlify init\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_065\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":100,\"end_line\":104,\"quote\":\"This guides user through:\\n1. Choosing team/account\\n2. Setting site name\\n3. Configuring build settings\\n4. Creating netlify.toml if needed\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/7/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/7/instructions/1\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"embedded_content\"],\"suggestions\":[{\"target_ids\":[\"fact:/blocks/7/instructions/0\"],\"change\":\"在 init 相关块中补充对 team/account、site name、build settings、netlify.toml 创建的可定位子步骤或约束，不要只依赖 netlify_init 名称。\",\"reason\":\"这些是源文明示的引导内容，当前只有开放操作名和脚本内容。\"}]},{\"id\":\"finding_8\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"部署前确保依赖安装：npm 项目运行 npm install；其他包管理器检测并使用合适命令。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_009 install_project_dependencies，块约束逐字记录 npm install 与其他包管理器检测，顺序在部署前。\",\"reason\":\"依赖安装动作、条件和顺序均被保留。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_066\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":106,\"end_line\":108,\"quote\":\"### 4. Verify Dependencies\\n\\nBefore deploying, ensure project dependencies are installed:\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_068\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":110,\"end_line\":116,\"quote\":\"```bash\\n# For npm projects\\nnpm install\\n\\n# For other package managers, detect and use appropriate command\\n# yarn install, pnpm install, etc.\\n```\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/8/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/8/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/12\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/13\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\",\"embedded_content\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_9\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"根据上下文选择部署类型：已有站点默认 Preview/Draft；新站点或显式生产部署使用 Production。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_010 choose_deployment_type 约束逐字记录该规则，输入 requested_deployment 和 site_is_new，输出 deployment_type。\",\"reason\":\"部署类型选择的条件和默认规则被保留；site_is_new 的路径可用性问题另列内部冲突。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_069\",\