置、本地构建、上传资产、返回部署 URL。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_011 deploy_to_netlify 输入 netlify-cli 与 deployment_type，输出 deployment_url 等；操作级约束逐字记录部署过程；metadata 保留两条命令。\",\"reason\":\"部署命令选择、部署类型输入和部署过程主语义均被记录；具体 netlify.toml 细节遗漏另列。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_072\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":124,\"end_line\":126,\"quote\":\"```bash\\nnpx netlify deploy\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_075\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":132,\"end_line\":134,\"quote\":\"```bash\\nnpx netlify deploy --prod\\n```\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_077\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":138,\"end_line\":142,\"quote\":\"**Deployment process**:\\n1. CLI detects build settings (from netlify.toml or prompts user)\\n2. Builds the project locally\\n3. Uploads built assets to Netlify\\n4. Returns deployment URL\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/metadata_json\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/14\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/15\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/16\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\",\"embedded_content\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_12\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"部署因网络问题失败时，用 sandbox_permissions=require_escalated 重跑；沙箱阻断出站请求时需要升级网络访问。\",\"actual_representation\":\"deploy 块以 network error 条件边到 block_013；block_013 deploy_to_netlify_escalated 使用 deployment_type 和字面量 require_escalated，之后到 block_014 报告升级部署结果。\",\"reason\":\"网络错误条件、升级参数和重跑动作均有记录；示例引导文本属于可选上下文。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_094\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":215,\"end_line\":215,\"quote\":\"If deployment fails due to network issues (timeouts, DNS errors, connection resets), rerun the deploy with escalated permissions (use `sandbox_permissions=require_escalated`). The deploy requires escalated network access when sandbox networking blocks outbound requests.\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/12/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/12/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/12/instructions/0/inputs/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/16\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/edges/17\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_13\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"mistranslated\",\"source_requirement\":\"报告 Deploy URL；Site URL 仅在 production deploy 时报告；Deploy logs 是打开 Netlify dashboard 的链接；Next steps 建议 netlify open 查看站点或 dashboard。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_012/014 format_deployment_report 无条件输入 site_url；deploy_logs 仅作为结果输入；next steps 字面量为 \\\"Run netlify open to view the site.\\\"，未保留 dashboard 或条件。\",\"reason\":\"Site URL 的条件被去掉，日志链接语义和 next steps 的 dashboard 选项未完整保留；这是局部错转而非整段遗漏。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_079\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":146,\"end_line\":150,\"quote\":\"After deployment, report to user:\\n- **Deploy URL**: Unique URL for this deployment\\n- **Site URL**: Production URL (if production deploy)\\n- **Deploy logs**: Link to Netlify dashboard for logs\\n- **Next steps**: Suggest `netlify open` to view site or dashboard\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/11/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/11/instructions/0/inputs/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/11/instructions/0/inputs/5\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/13/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/13/instructions/0/inputs/5\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"interpretation\"],\"suggestions\":[{\"target_ids\":[\"fact:/blocks/11/instructions/0/inputs/1\",\"fact:/blocks/11/instructions/0/inputs/5\",\"fact:/blocks/13/instructions/0/inputs/1\",\"fact:/blocks/13/instructions/0/inputs/5\"],\"change\":\"在报告块中记录 Site URL 仅在 production deploy 时使用，并把 next steps 补为查看站点或 dashboard；deploy logs 标明 dashboard 链接语义。\",\"reason\":\"源文对 Site URL、Deploy logs 和 next steps 有明确条件和对象，当前输入与字面量未完整保留。\"}]},{\"id\":\"finding_14\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"omitted\",\"source_requirement\":\"若 netlify.toml 存在则 CLI 自动使用；不存在则提示 build command 和 publish directory；记录 Next.js、Vite、Static HTML 默认；尝试从 package.json 检测框架并建议设置。\",\"actual_representation\":\"仅 deploy_to_netlify 操作约束概括为 CLI detects build settings from netlify.toml or prompts user；未记录文件存在性、提示字段、框架默认和 package.json 检测。\",\"reason\":\"源文这些具体构建设置处理要求没有被分别定位，开放约束不足以覆盖细节。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_081\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":154,\"end_line\":156,\"quote\":\"If a `netlify.toml` file exists, the CLI uses it automatically. If not, the CLI will prompt for:\\n- **Build command**: e.g., `npm run build`, `next build`\\n- **Publish directory**: e.g., `dist`, `build`, `.next`\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_082\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":158,\"end_line\":161,\"quote\":\"Common framework defaults:\\n- **Next.js**: build command `npm run build`, publish `.next`\\n- **React (Vite)**: build command `npm run build`, publish `dist`\\n- **Static HTML**: no build command, publish current directory\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_083\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":163,\"end_line\":163,\"quote\":\"The skill should detect framework from `package.json` if possible and suggest appropriate settings.\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/outputs/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/outputs/3\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"declared_constraint\",\"explicit_graph\"],\"suggestions\":[{\"target_ids\":[\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/constraints/0\",\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/outputs/2\",\"fact:/blocks/10/instructions/0/outputs/3\"],\"change\":\"补充 netlify.toml 存在性分支、build command/publish directory 提